WEBVTT

00:01:53.366 --> 00:01:54.026
This way please.

00:01:56.666 --> 00:01:59.796
He is the King of Jibral.

00:02:00.466 --> 00:02:02.126
Be sure to be polite.

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:06.403
Your Majesty,
these are the travelers

00:02:06.433 --> 00:02:09.103
who solved the problem
that occurred in the town.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:14.200
He is the King.

00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:19.566
KNIGHT MASTER

00:02:23.733 --> 00:02:26.373
I've heard about
your accomplishments.

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:29.870
And I would like to thank you
for getting rid of the problem.

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:32.200
You've brought a sense
of safety to our citizens.

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:36.200
On behalf of my people,
I express my gratitude.

00:02:40.633 --> 00:02:42.103
I shall give you a reward.

00:02:42.666 --> 00:02:44.866
You shall ask for
whatever you want.

00:02:45.633 --> 00:02:46.303
Well then...

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:49.573
Thank you very much,
Your Majesty.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:54.830
My request is the Book of
the Beginning in your Royal Library.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:03:00.130
The Book of the Beginning...
The world's oldest book?

00:03:01.333 --> 00:03:02.903
Is that Zola's purpose?

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:04.470
But...

00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:06.973
why does she want to read it?

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:12.130
The Book of the Beginning...
Conrad, see to it.

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.600
Yes, I will get it ready.

00:03:15.533 --> 00:03:16.533
Anything else?

00:03:16.933 --> 00:03:18.903
I'm hungry, maro.

00:03:19.266 --> 00:03:21.996
Oh, can I look around the castle?

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.270
If it's possible,
I want to take a bath.

00:03:28.333 --> 00:03:29.803
You kids sure have
a lot of energy!

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:31.930
Your Majesty,
leave the rest to me.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:37.030
If there's anything else you want,
don't hesitate to ask Conrad.

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:40.300
He will be able to grant
most of your wishes.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:41.530
- Hurray!
- Hurray!

00:03:41.566 --> 00:03:42.926
Excuse me, your Majesty.

00:03:43.933 --> 00:03:51.903
What are your thoughts on
Grankingdom's recent activities

00:03:51.933 --> 00:03:54.003
and all of their attacks lately?

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:59.500
Most likely, the ghost incident's suspect
belongs to the Grankingdom.

00:04:00.233 --> 00:04:03.903
We are not just
simply observing.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:07.570
We will not let them
have their way.

00:04:08.166 --> 00:04:12.496
Despite that, don't you think
this kingdom is a little too relaxed?

00:04:13.466 --> 00:04:16.896
What they're doing is
obviously a military act.

00:04:17.433 --> 00:04:20.773
If you don't consider it seriously,
you are going to pay the price.

00:04:21.966 --> 00:04:22.966
Stop it, Zola!

00:04:23.233 --> 00:04:24.303
You're going too far!

00:04:24.633 --> 00:04:28.273
The allied powers have loudly
protested Grankingdom's actions.

00:04:28.533 --> 00:04:32.233
The time for diplomacy and
empty gestures is long gone.

00:04:32.766 --> 00:04:34.526
Nene has made it clear
from the beginning

00:04:34.566 --> 00:04:36.296
that he has little use
for negotiation.

00:04:37.066 --> 00:04:39.426
W-What in the world?!

00:04:39.666 --> 00:04:42.796
The situation will most likely
change drastically soon.

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:46.130
That's all I can say for now.
You'll have to forgive me.

00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:50.203
Conrad, please see to our guests.

00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:51.326
Sire.

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:54.800
Legalas, you stay here.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:56.770
We would like to listen
to your report.

00:04:57.033 --> 00:04:58.033
Yes!

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:59.970
I will lead the way.
This way please.

00:05:11.133 --> 00:05:15.073
The other kingdoms' leaders
all signed this petition.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:16.870
It proves their strong determination.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:17.870
Oh...

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.400
Well then...

00:05:19.733 --> 00:05:22.333
Your Majesty's aspiration
has been communicated.

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:26.300
The alliance with the other
kingdoms has been formed.

00:05:28.833 --> 00:05:29.503
Huh?

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.500
What?

00:05:34.966 --> 00:05:38.996
They're standing at attention...
to honor us?

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:43.370
Don't worry,
no one is saluting you.

00:05:44.033 --> 00:05:45.773
Then, who are they saluting?

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.770
Have you not noticed?

00:05:48.233 --> 00:05:49.433
What are you talking about?

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.530
Geez, you talked about him
so many times.

00:05:52.166 --> 00:05:53.866
You sure are a country bumpkin.

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:56.370
Just get to the point already.

00:05:56.533 --> 00:05:59.373
I want to know too.
Tell me, Jiro.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:02.530
That's the guy being saluted.

00:06:03.033 --> 00:06:03.703
What?

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.800
That guy?

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.570
Are you talking about Conrad?

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.330
Conrad L. Lorentz.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:13.030
He is Jibral Kingdom's
number one Knight Master.

00:06:13.566 --> 00:06:16.626
I thought the entire kingdom
knew about him,

00:06:16.666 --> 00:06:20.026
but I guess his fame hasn't
reached your village.

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:24.000
A Knight Master?!
Like, a Knight Master Knight Master?!

00:06:24.133 --> 00:06:25.333
Is there any other kind?

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:33.100
He is the admirable
Knight Master?

00:06:35.066 --> 00:06:37.026
This is the daily report from
the Seventh Division Fleet.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:40.230
We are advancing from
point 203 to 206.

00:06:40.633 --> 00:06:43.273
Three Scout Squads have
deployed reconnaissance.

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:45.270
The enemy still hasn't moved
from their position.

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:51.400
How's the situation?

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:55.570
Things are going fine.
The plan will start as scheduled.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:57.300
I see...

00:06:58.333 --> 00:07:00.273
I'm leaving it up to you, Dragnov.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.400
What a nice breeze!

00:07:05.833 --> 00:07:08.033
Lieutenant Dragnov, please stop.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.670
Please come back!

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:12.730
If something happens to you,
the plan will fail!

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:16.770
Idiot! Stop whining for
something like this.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:19.270
Do I look like a sheltered little girl?

00:07:19.333 --> 00:07:20.673
B-But...

00:07:21.033 --> 00:07:26.433
I'm thrilled. So I'm feeling
the breeze to contain myself.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.930
Now send these orders to
each ship in the fleet!

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:31.530
Prepare for battle!

00:07:31.833 --> 00:07:33.273
R-Roger!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.630
Jibral Kingdom has been undefeated
for two hundred years.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.230
Today, I'm going to put an end to it!

00:07:42.933 --> 00:07:44.803
- Wow!
- Wow!

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:47.870
- Let's eat!
- Let's eat!

00:07:54.033 --> 00:07:55.533
What's wrong, Shu?

00:07:59.233 --> 00:08:00.473
This is bad.

00:08:01.133 --> 00:08:04.303
He probably can't hear
anything right now.

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:05.570
Maro...

00:08:07.466 --> 00:08:09.366
He is still willing to eat.

00:08:10.433 --> 00:08:12.503
Knight Master...

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:14.000
Please accept my apology.

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:17.900
It seems like the request to
the Royal Library will take a little longer.

00:08:18.566 --> 00:08:22.296
Since it is the world's oldest book,
it is under tight security.

00:08:22.566 --> 00:08:24.596
Please, don't worry.

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:30.370
I am grateful to be given
the opportunity to take a look at it.

00:08:30.733 --> 00:08:31.403
Thank you.

00:08:32.666 --> 00:08:34.366
Stop being so stubborn!

00:08:34.533 --> 00:08:35.903
Tell us who you are and
who you work for.

00:08:36.066 --> 00:08:38.396
You are a Grankingdom soldier, right?!

00:08:39.233 --> 00:08:41.473
I don't know what
you're talking about.

00:08:41.833 --> 00:08:43.903
What you did is a serious crime.

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:48.200
If you don't cooperate with us,
then you will need to pay the price.

00:08:48.966 --> 00:08:50.796
Yeah, well...

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:52.900
Take the plea deal.

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:55.200
If you do so, at least
your life will be saved.

00:08:56.566 --> 00:08:59.026
Well, fine. There's plenty of time.

00:08:59.133 --> 00:09:00.473
We'll take it slow.

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:02.470
Well...

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.700
We'll see about that...

00:09:06.833 --> 00:09:11.273
"Mr. Conrad, why did you want
to become a Knight Master?"

00:09:11.666 --> 00:09:13.296
Can you ask him that?

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:16.100
You are pretty shy, aren't you?

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.870
It's not like that.

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:22.200
My father was also a Knight.

00:09:22.933 --> 00:09:27.103
So I set my sights on being
a Knight Master from a very early age.

00:09:27.633 --> 00:09:30.133
Oh, uh, umm...

00:09:30.833 --> 00:09:32.573
Shu, right?

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:38.530
As the King said, if there is anything
you want, you just ask me.

00:09:39.033 --> 00:09:41.203
Yes, um...

00:09:41.366 --> 00:09:43.496
Do you want to become
a Knight Master yourself?

00:09:43.833 --> 00:09:44.833
- Maro.
- Huh?

00:09:45.166 --> 00:09:46.696
No, I...

00:09:48.833 --> 00:09:49.503
I...

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:54.000
Listen, Shu.

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:57.900
Whatever you strive for in life,
one thing remains the same.

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:00.500
The important thing is

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:04.900
the heart to love others.

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:06.700
Heart?

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:10.800
I love the King and the people.

00:10:11.633 --> 00:10:15.203
The bigger the heart,
the more power you will gain.

00:10:16.433 --> 00:10:19.973
That power can at times
make miracles happen.

00:10:20.933 --> 00:10:23.173
Make miracles happen?

00:10:23.833 --> 00:10:26.203
That's right.
You should remember that.

00:10:28.866 --> 00:10:29.526
Yes!

00:10:32.466 --> 00:10:35.026
This is it. I finally made it.

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:39.500
Jibral Castle...
Everyone is here.

00:10:44.566 --> 00:10:46.726
The main battery is fully loaded
and ready to fire.

00:10:47.066 --> 00:10:48.566
Adjusting target coordinates.

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:50.930
Trajectory calculations
have been revised.

00:10:51.333 --> 00:10:52.603
Safety disengaged.

00:10:53.133 --> 00:10:54.133
Lieutenant Dragnov!

00:10:55.766 --> 00:10:56.826
Fire!

00:11:01.866 --> 00:11:06.326
Wait up, Shu...
I am not going to let you go!

00:11:12.233 --> 00:11:12.903
Huh?!

00:11:33.633 --> 00:11:34.633
What?!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.000
That emblem!

00:11:37.733 --> 00:11:39.303
It's Grankingdom!

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.470
Let's go, everyone!

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:44.000
- Right!
- Right!

00:11:44.366 --> 00:11:45.366
Wait!

00:11:46.866 --> 00:11:49.366
Leave this up to us.

00:11:50.066 --> 00:11:50.726
But...

00:11:51.466 --> 00:11:52.966
This is our fatherland.

00:11:53.833 --> 00:11:56.803
As Knights, it's our duty.
Besides, you're our guests here.

00:11:57.533 --> 00:12:02.033
We can't allow you to
put yourselves in danger.

00:12:02.466 --> 00:12:06.166
That's right, you are this kingdom's
distinguished people,

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.400
so you should stay here.

00:12:07.533 --> 00:12:09.373
No wonder you're a Knight Master.

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:12.000
Everything he says is cool!

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:13.700
Are you ignoring me?

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:15.100
I understand.

00:12:15.466 --> 00:12:17.496
As long as this place is safe,
we will not lend a hand.

00:12:17.933 --> 00:12:19.473
So let's see what you can do.

00:12:20.066 --> 00:12:21.896
I will definitely protect you.

00:12:22.766 --> 00:12:23.766
Mr. Conrad!

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.130
Please do your best!

00:12:27.833 --> 00:12:28.503
Yeah!

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:44.070
W-What's going on?!

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:56.300
It seems like it's begun.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:03.130
Well then...

00:13:07.233 --> 00:13:08.673
Please report the situation.

00:13:09.233 --> 00:13:10.573
Thirteen enemy ships, sir.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.600
They're all firing with
no signs of stopping.

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:17.700
All gun ports, intercept individually.
Aim at the starboard.

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:20.530
Get Cyclops ready to attack.

00:13:21.433 --> 00:13:22.103
However,

00:13:22.133 --> 00:13:24.633
have them on standby at designated
positions until orders are given.

00:13:25.166 --> 00:13:26.166
- Roger.
- Roger.

00:13:27.366 --> 00:13:28.466
We need to be patient here.

00:13:29.366 --> 00:13:31.926
I'm certain that they're going
to send men ashore.

00:13:32.966 --> 00:13:34.196
When they do,
we'll attack them at once!

00:13:34.766 --> 00:13:35.426
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:13:37.366 --> 00:13:38.626
Don't panic!

00:13:39.066 --> 00:13:42.196
The Jibral Castle has not been
defeated in the past 200 years.

00:13:47.533 --> 00:13:52.703
The castle's walls are made
of legendary Hexa-steel!

00:14:07.833 --> 00:14:11.703
As expected, they're standing firm
against an ordinary attack.

00:14:12.066 --> 00:14:14.166
They aren't attempting to evacuate.

00:14:14.533 --> 00:14:17.273
And they aren't trying to
intercept us at sea in a hurry.

00:14:17.733 --> 00:14:19.203
They have a wise commander.

00:14:19.533 --> 00:14:20.203
Lieutenant!

00:14:20.566 --> 00:14:21.226
What is it?

00:14:21.566 --> 00:14:24.026
Is there any way we can have you
come inside to the bridge?

00:14:24.766 --> 00:14:26.166
Don't make me repeat myself!

00:14:26.766 --> 00:14:29.466
I will not get hit! Ever!

00:14:35.166 --> 00:14:37.066
Please take it easy.

00:14:40.433 --> 00:14:41.433
We've found the command ship.

00:14:42.166 --> 00:14:43.396
It's at the center of the frontline.

00:14:43.966 --> 00:14:46.626
We believe that these are Dragnov's forces
from the Seventh Division Fleet.

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:49.100
The Lucky Dragnov...

00:14:50.033 --> 00:14:51.403
He's a difficult opponent.

00:14:52.766 --> 00:14:54.596
Concentrate your attacks
on the command ship!

00:14:55.233 --> 00:14:57.833
Station the Cyclops
along the castle wall!

00:14:58.333 --> 00:14:59.873
We'll put an end to this at once!

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:06.100
What are they?

00:15:06.166 --> 00:15:07.166
Soldier Beasts.

00:15:07.733 --> 00:15:09.003
Soldier Beasts?

00:15:17.233 --> 00:15:19.773
So that's Jibral's secret weapon, huh?

00:15:19.833 --> 00:15:20.973
The third ship's been destroyed!

00:15:21.966 --> 00:15:23.826
Don't push them.
Have them retreat.

00:15:24.433 --> 00:15:27.703
I don't need ones with
bad luck on my battlefield.

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:31.500
Well then, shall we use
our secret weapon?!

00:15:31.966 --> 00:15:33.696
W-Wow...

00:15:33.833 --> 00:15:36.803
Mr. Conrad is directing
all this, right?

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:39.330
It looks like he's driving
the attackers away!

00:15:40.333 --> 00:15:42.203
Aren't you forgetting something?

00:15:42.733 --> 00:15:43.403
Huh?

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:45.770
If this is an ordinary battle,
then this is fine.

00:15:46.433 --> 00:15:48.773
But the opponent is
Grankingdom.

00:15:49.733 --> 00:15:52.173
Send in the Black
Shadow Type Ones!

00:15:52.866 --> 00:15:53.966
Let's take them down!

00:15:54.066 --> 00:15:56.196
Be sure you get the data!

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:09.570
That's...

00:16:20.400 --> 00:16:21.070
Shadows?!

00:16:21.333 --> 00:16:25.233
But...there's something different
about them.

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:35.570
They're using Shadow troops?!

00:16:36.433 --> 00:16:37.873
How dare you, Grankingdom!

00:16:40.133 --> 00:16:41.833
What an offense.

00:16:42.066 --> 00:16:43.226
Would they be okay?

00:16:43.766 --> 00:16:44.766
Mr. Conrad...

00:16:46.966 --> 00:16:49.996
This must be the result
of Nene's research.

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:03.100
No way! The Hexa-steel!

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:04.970
The castle wall has been destroyed!

00:17:18.133 --> 00:17:23.173
The Jibral's wall that was
undefeated for 200 years...

00:17:24.433 --> 00:17:26.673
I am gonna win this battle!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:30.370
Launch the landing craft!
Finish them off at once!

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:47.770
The enemy is climbing
the castle wall!

00:17:48.233 --> 00:17:50.373
Several reports of damage.
At this pace...

00:17:51.366 --> 00:17:53.666
We'll fight hand-to-hand!
We're going to fight too!

00:17:54.633 --> 00:17:58.773
Time to reveal the full power
of the Royal Knights!

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:10.130
Is this it?

00:18:37.866 --> 00:18:39.826
Jibral is going to get destroyed!

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:42.670
Charge!

00:19:04.933 --> 00:19:08.673
Stand firm, no matter what!
Stop them here!

00:19:15.133 --> 00:19:15.803
What?!

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:18.070
You are...

00:19:18.866 --> 00:19:22.326
I'm sorry, but we are going
to fight too.

00:19:23.066 --> 00:19:24.366
Let's go everyone!

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:25.270
Maro!

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:26.370
Don't tell me what to do!

00:19:54.166 --> 00:19:56.466
These are your Shadows...

00:19:57.833 --> 00:20:00.973
Knight Master!
Please leave this up to us!

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:15.400
What is this?!

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:18.970
Impossible! Automatons
controlling the Shadows?!

00:20:19.833 --> 00:20:20.973
Worry about all that later.

00:20:21.466 --> 00:20:24.266
Do your best right now
to beat these guys!

00:20:25.066 --> 00:20:27.226
I know! You don't have
to tell me, maro.

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:30.530
You shall receive my Iron Justice!

00:20:33.433 --> 00:20:34.673
Waves of Rage!

00:20:42.733 --> 00:20:45.603
Our Black Shadow Type Ones
are disappearing one after the other!

00:20:46.166 --> 00:20:48.766
The rate of the invasion unit
that landed is twelve percent.

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:51.070
We haven't breached
the inside yet!

00:20:51.933 --> 00:20:53.203
What's going on?

00:20:53.466 --> 00:20:56.596
We are using all of our best troops.

00:20:57.533 --> 00:20:58.673
Reporting from the frontline!

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:00.530
The enemy has
Shadow Wielders!

00:21:01.066 --> 00:21:02.366
Shadow Wielders?!

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.000
A total of four,

00:21:04.033 --> 00:21:07.003
and most of the damage
was caused by these four!

00:21:09.133 --> 00:21:13.833
I see... So they had
a secret weapon too, huh?

00:21:15.466 --> 00:21:17.426
Have we collected enough data?

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:18.870
Yes, sir.

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:25.800
I guess those prototypes weren't
ready to go up against a real Shadow...

00:21:27.366 --> 00:21:28.366
That's too bad!

00:21:28.466 --> 00:21:29.566
All forces, withdraw!

00:21:29.833 --> 00:21:31.803
Leave the front immediately!

00:21:44.666 --> 00:21:46.326
Right there!

00:21:48.166 --> 00:21:50.326
Ready to give up, Grankingdom?!

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:52.570
You were just shaking
until a second ago.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:58.630
Evacuation order, all troops withdraw!

00:22:11.966 --> 00:22:13.526
Not too bad of a result.

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:17.200
Is this it?

00:22:23.966 --> 00:22:25.926
Oh yeah, I got it.

00:22:27.300 --> 00:22:29.730
You promised. Now, make meâ€”

00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:35.000
N-No way...

00:24:21.766 --> 00:24:23.366
Bouquet who tries to win Shu's heart

00:24:23.400 --> 00:24:27.000
becomes the magical girl Fluffy Bouquet
and casts a spell of love.

00:24:27.200 --> 00:24:31.700
Now Shu is going to be all mine.
Shu, hurry and jump into me!

00:24:31.733 --> 00:24:34.273
Miss Fluffy Bouquet, you're cute.

00:24:34.300 --> 00:24:37.000
Wait, this is not the Shu I know!

00:24:37.033 --> 00:24:39.673
Next on Blue Dragon:
"Operation Marriage Proposal."
